### @env local
@venueId = 1
@orgId = 2

### ========================================================================
### 1. 模拟登录 - 普通用户 (获取 Token)
### ========================================================================
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openid": "openid_002"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}


### ========================================================================
### 2. 模拟登录 - 管理员 (获取 Token)
### ========================================================================
POST {{baseURL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openid": "openid_001"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}


### ========================================================================
### 3. 场景A：个人提交演出申请 (格式修正版) (Pass)
### ========================================================================
POST {{baseURL}}/performance/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="data"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "个人吉他路演11",
  "description": "个人练习生练习时长两年半的成果展示",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "organizerType": "USER",
  "organizerId": 1,
  "applyReason": "个人才艺展示",
  "sessions": [
    {
      "venueId": {{venueId}},
      "startTime": "2026-02-24T19:00:00",
      "endTime": "2026-02-26T21:00:00",
      "ticketTotal": 50
    }
  ],
  "staffList": [
    {
      "staffName": "练习生A",
      "staffType": "主唱",
      "staffAvatar": "avatar_a.jpg",
      "introduction": "热爱音乐",
      "sortOrder": 1
    }
  ]
}
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="poster"; filename="my_poster.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="staffPhotos"; filename="avatar_a.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--


### ========================================================================
### 4. 场景B：社团/组织提交演出申请 (格式修正版) (Pass)
### ========================================================================
POST {{baseURL}}/performance/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="data"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "话剧社年度大戏《雷雨》",
  "description": "话剧社全员出演",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "organizerType": "ORGANIZATION",
  "organizerId": {{orgId}},
  "applyReason": "年度汇演",
  "sessions": [
    {
      "venueId": {{venueId}},
      "startTime": "2026-12-25T19:00:00",
      "endTime": "2026-12-25T22:00:00",
      "ticketTotal": 500
    }
  ],
  "staffList": [
    {
      "staffName": "导演王",
      "staffType": "导演",
      "staffAvatar": "director.jpg",
      "introduction": "总导演",
      "sortOrder": 1
    },
    {
      "staffName": "演员李",
      "staffType": "主演",
      "staffAvatar": "actor.jpg",
      "introduction": "男一号",
      "sortOrder": 2
    }
  ]
}
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="poster"; filename="drama_poster.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="staffPhotos"; filename="director.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="staffPhotos"; filename="actor.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--


### ========================================================================
### 5. 场景C：管理员强制征用场地 (格式修正版) (Pass)
### ========================================================================
POST {{baseURL}}/admin/performance/preempt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="data"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "【校级】新年晚会彩排",
  "description": "最高优先级活动，征用场地",
  "categoryId": 2,
  "organizerType": "ORGANIZATION",
  "organizerId": 1,
  "sessions": [
    {
      "venueId": {{venueId}},
      "startTime": "2026-12-25T18:00:00",
      "endTime": "2026-12-25T22:00:00",
      "ticketTotal": 0
    }
  ],
  "staffList": []
}
--WebAppBoundary--


### ========================================================================
### 6. [修改] 场景D：举办者(Organizer) 仅修改场次时间 (延期) - 应成功 (Pass)
### ========================================================================
# 预期结果：状态码 200，sessions 时间更新。
PUT {{baseURL}}/performance/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="performanceCmd.performanceId"

3
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sessions[0].venueId"

{{venueId}}
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sessions[0].startTime"

2026-12-27T19:00:00
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sessions[0].endTime"

2026-12-27T22:00:00
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sessions[0].ticketTotal"

50
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="delayReason"

因天气原因延期一天
--WebAppBoundary--


### ========================================================================
### 7. [修改] 场景E：举办者(Organizer) 尝试修改标题和海报 - 应被忽略 (Pass)
### ========================================================================
# 预期结果：状态码 200 (接口通畅)，但返回的 data 中 title 仍为 "原始标题-吉他路演"，海报未变。
# 后台日志应显示 "举办者尝试修改演出内容被忽略..."
PUT {{baseURL}}/performance/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="performanceCmd.performanceId"

3
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="performanceCmd.title"

举办者试图篡改的标题
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="newPosterFile"; filename="hacker_poster.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--


### ========================================================================
### 8. [修改] 场景F：管理员(Admin) 全量修改 - 应全部生效 (Pass)
### ========================================================================
# 预期结果：状态码 200，title 变为 "管理员修改后的标题"，海报更新，人员增加，状态变为已发布(1)。
PUT {{baseURL}}/performance/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="data"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "performanceCmd": {
    "performanceId": 3,
    "title": "管理员修改后的标题JSON版",
    "description": "管理员审核通过。",
    "publishStatus": 1
  },
  "sessions": [
    {
      "venueId": {{venueId}},
      "startTime": "2026-12-30T18:00:00",
      "endTime": "2026-12-30T22:00:00",
      "ticketTotal": 100
    }
  ],
  "staffList": [
    {
      "staffName": "李四",
      "staffType": "嘉宾",
      "introduction": "特邀",
      "sortOrder": 2,
      "staffAvatar": "lisi.jpg"
    },
    {
      "staffName": "王五",
      "staffType": "嘉宾",
      "introduction": "特邀",
      "sortOrder": 3
    }
  ]
}
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="newPosterFile"; filename="admin_poster.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="staffPhotoFiles"; filename="zhangsan.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="staffPhotoFiles"; filename="lisi.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--


### ========================================================================
### 9. 分页查询 - 无筛选条件 (默认查所有)(Pass)
### ========================================================================
GET {{baseURL}}/performance/list?page=0&size=5
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================================================
### 10. 分页查询 - 按状态筛选 (查已发布 status=1) (Pass)
### ========================================================================
GET {{baseURL}}/performance/list?status=1&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================================================
### 11. 分页查询 - 按关键词搜索 (标题或描述包含 "Concert") (Pass)
### ========================================================================
GET {{baseURL}}/performance/list?keyword=Concert&status=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================================================
### 12. 分页查询 - 按分类筛选 (categoryId=1) (Pass)
### ========================================================================
GET {{baseURL}}/performance/list?categoryId=1&status=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================================================
### 13. 分页查询 - 组合筛选 (关键词 + 分类 + 状态) (Pass)
### ========================================================================
GET {{baseURL}}/performance/list?keyword=新年&categoryId=1&status=1&page=0&size=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================================================
### 14. 获取演出详情 (ID=1) (Pass)
### ========================================================================
GET {{baseURL}}/performance/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================================================
### 15. 获取演出详情 - 不存在的ID (测试 500/400 异常返回) (Pass)
### ========================================================================
GET {{baseURL}}/performance/99999
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}